+## Errors in beforeSession
+
+- When `beforeSession` throws an `Error`, `onError` fires with `(session, error)` and the rejection still reaches the caller ([validated by: fires onError with session and error and still rejects on throw](../../src/orchestration/beforeSessionFailure.acceptance.test.ts#L18)).
+- When `beforeSession` throws, `afterSession` runs after `onError` while `beforeUserInput`, `afterUserInput`, `beforeModelResponse`, and `afterModelResponse` do not run, so an `afterSession` hook can assume no downstream turn phase occurred and must tolerate setup that failed partway through `beforeSession` ([validated by: runs onError then afterSession and skips turn hooks on throw](../../src/orchestration/beforeSessionFailure.acceptance.test.ts#L48)).
